WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
[Quiet room. A headset is picked up.]

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.350
Caller: My AC stopped cooling.
Can I get a visit tomorrow?

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:10.950
Voice Agent: What’s your ZIP code?
And does tomorrow morning work?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.450
[Soft typing and paper rustling.]
Dispatch receives the repair enquiry and requested time.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Chatversio AI. Chat Agent, Sales Agent and Voice Agent.
